# Baked into the production bundle at build time by Vite.
#
# Here rather than only in the host's dashboard so a deploy is reproducible from
# the repository: the same commit builds the same bundle anywhere, and nobody has
# to know a setting only one person can see. A dashboard variable of the same
# name still wins if one is set, which is what you want for a one-off override.
#
# Not a secret. It ships inside the JavaScript and anyone can read it — which is
# also why nothing secret may ever go in this file.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://chronos-backend-zwfh.onrender.com
